-          <p>Together with the other features in Distributed hosting &amp; preservation, it pushes ForkMesh toward a code forge that can be hosted, mirrored, reviewed, and funded by the people using it.</p>
+          <p>Use zero-custody relay when availability, clone routing, and preservation need to be handled by the mesh instead of by a single origin.</p>
